product_description.description:
pjur AQUA leaves no sticky film – only an exquisite overall feeling.&nbsp; 

pjur AQUA moisturizes, protects and nourishes dry, damaged skin.&nbsp;

This pleasant skin feeling enhances sexual pleasure and the desire for more!&nbsp; 

The lubricant contains no fats, oils or perfumes, and is therefore positively skin and mucous membrane compatible. 

This quality has been confirmed by the Stiftung Warentest* Foundation which gave the mucous membrane compatibility and microbiological quality of pjur AQUA a “very good” grading. 

The water-based formula with its excellent glide properties is easy to wash off and perfectly suitable for use with erotic toys.

